            &=  m^2 + 2m + 1 \tag{by the induction hypothesis}\\
            &= (m + 1)^2
    \end{align}

    This proves the induction step, and therefore by the principle of mathematical induction. The claim holds true for all $n \in \N$.
\end{itemize}

